        "text_W4YYQp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p>Embark on an unforgettable Megalithic Temples of Malta tour, where you’ll explore ancient Maltese sacred sites, powerful ley lines, and earth energy patterns. Discover the long-lost civilization behind the Hagar Qim Temples and Mnajdra Temples, two of Malta’s most awe-inspiring prehistoric wonders. Learn to dowse and connect with unique aerial and earth energies in the Land of the Goddess on this immersive guided tour.</p><p>This Malta tour offers a flexible and budget-friendly experience, allowing you to book your own flights, accommodation, and meals while we handle all transportation. Enjoy a scenic ferry ride to Gozo, visit breathtaking sites, and experience the mystical energy of these ancient landmarks.</p><p>Led by expert tour guide Maria Wheatley, this full-day sightseeing tour provides deep insights into Malta’s rich history and sacred landscapes.  Daily pickups are from the <a href=\"https://europahotelmalta.com/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Europa Hotel in Sliema</span></a>, with nearby options like Hotel Roma or local Airbnbs for added flexibility. Maria will be staying at Europa Hotel in Slimea (approximately 60-90 Euro per night if booked in advance, or book an AirBnB).</p><p>Book now for a day tour through Malta’s most spiritually charged temples and uncover the hidden mysteries of the Mediterranean!</p>"
          }
        }
      },
