            "parent_column": "center",
            "code": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"55.914\" height=\"63.966\" viewBox=\"0 0 55.914 55.914\" style=\"margin: 0 auto 15px; display: block;\"><path d=\"M53.322,3H8.591A5.572,5.572,0,0,0,3,8.591V39.344a5.572,5.572,0,0,0,5.591,5.591H19.774V58.914l11.183-5.591L42.14,58.914V44.935H53.322a5.572,5.572,0,0,0,5.591-5.591V8.591A5.572,5.572,0,0,0,53.322,3Zm0,36.344H8.591V33.752H53.322Zm0-13.978H8.591V8.591H53.322Z\" transform=\"translate(-3 -3)\" fill=\"#02b5b4\"/></svg>"
