            "text": "<p>The hotel’s rooms are book blocked for our group, however, you can ONLY BOOK BY PHONE OR EMAIL<br/><br/><strong>Please contact Darlene<br/>+1-530-859 2634<br/></strong><a href=\"mailto:info@mccloudmercantile.com\">info@mccloudmercantile.com</a><br/><br/>It is not possible to book rooms on the hotel website for our event days.</p>",
